scratch/

# Working docs -- for this session, not for a repo reviewer
CLAUDE.md
MetaFlex_Build_Plan_v2.pdf
MetaFlex_Skills_and_Deliverables_v2.pdf

# Data — raw is never committed (repo rule). interim/processed are
# regenerated by the pipeline from raw + src/, so they aren't committed
# either — EXCEPT the specific parquet files the deployed dashboard reads
# (decided 2026-09-13): the dataset is public, so shipping already-audited
# pipeline output isn't a privacy issue, and Streamlit Cloud gets no local
# filesystem or data/raw/ to regenerate them from. Everything else in
# data/interim/ and data/processed/ stays ignored.
data/raw/
data/interim/*
data/processed/*
!data/interim/table_a_clean.parquet
!data/interim/table_b_clean.parquet
!data/processed/summarize_table_a.parquet

# Belt-and-suspenders for "no hand-editing data in Excel, ever" -- no .xls/
# .xlsx can be committed anywhere in the repo, not just in data/raw/.
*.xls
*.xlsx
